1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
[DISTANT TRAIN HORN]

2
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,500
The station closes before midnight.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,900
Then we should leave now.

4
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,500
Did you bring the map?

5
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,500
It is in the blue case.

6
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,500
Keep your voice down.

7
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,500
Someone is outside.

8
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,500
The hallway is empty.

9
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,100
Check the second door.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,500
[DOOR CLOSES]

11
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,500
This lock is new.

12
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,400
Use the smaller key.

13
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,500
That was not here yesterday.

14
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:50,500
Take a picture of it.

15
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:03,000
The signal is gone.

16
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:16,500
We can send it from the roof.

17
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
[PHONE RINGS]

18
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,300
Wait, I heard the elevator.

19
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,500
Hide behind the cabinet.

20
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:59,500
They passed us.

21
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:14,900
We only have ten minutes.

22
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:30,500
The stairs are blocked.

23
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,500
[MARA SIGHS]

24
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,300
There is another route.

25
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,000
Follow the red cable.

26
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:21,500
The control room is ahead.

27
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:39,500
Do not touch the alarm.

28
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
[MUSIC SWELLS]

29
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,500
I found the main switch.
